Z||000004||fropuff||09-30-2001||10:52 PM||||If you don't mind me asking; how do you take it off?  I mean, how many bolts are there?  I didn't know you have to take the headliner off; I just recovered it and put it back on.  I'm going to have to take it off soon, and I'm just wondering.  Thanks for any help.||||reg||1
Z||000005||FieroBUZZ||10-01-2001||09:46 AM||||On an SE....  Remove fender liner/quarter panel bolts/screws rivets as needed.<P>Bolts along top of fender and rear Under lights.<P>Bolts on roof to interior (headliner out) and also 3 bolts from the top along sunroof channel under the front roof (must be slightly raised for access.<P>I'll post pics if you need them.<BR>Gary||||reg||4
